sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Browser as Browser (PCS Banker)
    participant SF as Salesforce
    participant Mosaic as Mosaic App
    participant Cache as Redis (Mosaic Cache)
    participant Okta as Okta (IdP)

    Browser->>SF: Click "Launch Onboarding"
    
    Note over SF, Mosaic: Phase 1: Server-to-Server Stash
    SF->>Mosaic: POST /api/handoff { opportunityId: "123" }
    Mosaic->>Cache: Save { opportunityId: "123" } with 60s TTL
    Cache-->>Mosaic: Return token (e.g., 'xyz')
    Mosaic-->>SF: Response: { handoffToken: "xyz" }
    
    Note over SF, Browser: Phase 2: Browser Redirect
    SF-->>Browser: Trigger Redirect
    Note over Browser, Mosaic: HTTP GET /onboard?token=xyz
    
    Mosaic->>Mosaic: Encode 'token=xyz' into 'state'
    Mosaic-->>Browser: HTTP 302 Redirect
    Browser->>Okta: HTTP GET /authorize?state=[encoded_token]
    Browser->>Okta: Authenticate User
    Okta-->>Browser: HTTP 302 Redirect
    Browser->>Mosaic: HTTP GET /callback?state=[encoded_token]
    
    Mosaic->>Mosaic: Decode state, extract token
    Mosaic->>Cache: Fetch 'opportunityId' using 'xyz'
    Mosaic->>Cache: Delete Cache Entry
    Mosaic-->>Browser: Render UI with Opportunity Context
