sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Browser as Browser (PCS Banker)
    participant SF as Salesforce
    participant Mosaic as Mosaic App
    participant Okta as Okta (IdP)

    Browser->>SF: Click "Launch Onboarding"
    SF->>Browser: JavaScript triggers hidden form submit
    
    Note over Browser, Mosaic: HTTP POST /onboard <br/> Body: { oppId: "123" }
    Mosaic->>Mosaic: Detect no session.<br/>Read POST payload.
    
    Note right of Mosaic: Set cookie<br/>during a rapid redirect.
    Mosaic-->>Browser: HTTP 302 Redirect <br/> + Set-Cookie: context=123
    
    Note over Browser, Okta: HTTP GET /authorize <br/> (Original POST Body is dropped)
    Browser->>Okta: Authenticate User
    Okta-->>Browser: HTTP 302 Redirect
    
    Note over Browser, Mosaic: HTTP GET /callback
    Mosaic->>Mosaic: Read 'context' Cookie
    
    Mosaic-->>Browser: Render UI with Context
